  "schema:name": "Stakeholder",
  "schema:description": "An individual, role, or organization with an interest in the outcomes of the architecture. \n\n\n\nStakeholders set or influence goals and are linked to the values they expect to receive. \n\nTypical stakeholders in healthcare include patients and other health service users, health workers, facilities, regulators, public health agencies and international agencies.",
